                        Chad</orgName><p>This attribution was rejected in both the first and second
                        editions of Medieval Libraries of Great Britain (1941, 1964). There were no
                        relevant change in the Supplement (1987). The corresponding Medieval
                        Libraries of Great Britain index card originally recorded just the following
                        evidence, which was deemed unsatisfactory for an attribution: <q>probably
                           from Buildwas</q> (M. R. James).</p><p>However, the attribution was later
                        accepted in MLGB3 (2010-2015). Compare the following revision to the index
                        card (dated 1989): For reason for identifying as a Buildwas book, see
                           <title>Transactions of the Cambridge Bibliographical Society</title> IX/3
                        (1988), 281-8.</p></provenance>
